{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"724","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"20家石化業排碳量 占全球35%","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: 0.75pt; background: white;\\\">2019-10-11 02:23</span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: 0.75pt; background: white;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; word-spacing: 0px;\\\">經濟日報 國際中心／綜合外電</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/%E7%A2%B3%E6%8E%92%E6%94%BE%E9%87%8F.jpg\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 400px; height: 266px;\\\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\\\">經濟日報/提供</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">衛報<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">9</span>日引述美國氣候責任研究所（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Climate Accountability Institute</span>）的分析報導指出，全球<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">20</span>家化石燃料公司不斷開採石油、天然氣及煤炭，在<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1965</span>年到<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2017</span>年所造成的溫室氣體排放量，占了全世界排放量的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">35%</span>，相當於<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4,800</span>億噸的二氧化碳當量。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">這項分析是由氣候研究所研究員海德（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Richard Heede</span>）所做。他主要評估從<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1965</span>年來，全球企業從地面抽取化石燃料、以及之後這些化石燃料所造成的排放量，占了多少比率。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">研究發現，從<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1965</span>年到<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2017</span>年，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">20</span>家化石燃料企業所造成、能源相關的二氧化碳與甲烷排放量，占了全球排放量的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">35%</span>。這<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">20</span>家化石燃料公司，包括沙烏地阿拉伯國家石油公司（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Saudi Aramco</span>）、俄羅斯天然氣（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Gazprom</span>）等<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">12</span>家國營公司，以及埃克森美孚（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Exccon Mobil</span>）、殼牌（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Shell</span>）和英國石油（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">BP</span>）等八家知名民營公司。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">研究指出，雪佛龍（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Chevron</span>）、埃克森、英國石油及殼牌等四家民營公司，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1965</span>年來造成的碳排放量占全球的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">10%</span>以上，而<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Aramco</span>一家公司的碳排放量就占了全球的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4.38%</span>。殼牌、埃克森、雪佛龍、中國石油等企業表示，支持巴黎氣候協定訂出的減少碳排目標，且正在投資再生能源或低碳能源。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">殼牌也在<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">10</span>日宣布，將在英國為<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">150</span>萬輛汽車進行碳中和計畫，免費實施至明年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">9</span>月。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">這項分析利用各公司聲稱的石油、天然氣及煤炭產量，計算在製造過程中，從開採到最後使用，會有多少二氧化碳和甲烷散放至空氣中。分析發現，約<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">90%</span>的碳排是在使用燃料時造成，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">10%</span>來自開採、運送。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">氣候科學家曼恩（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Michael Mann</span>）說，這項分析凸顯化石燃料公司在氣候暖化所扮演的角色，並呼籲<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">12</span>月將出席智利氣候會議的政治人物採取行動。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資料來源：<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">https://money.udn.com/money/story/5599/4098199</span></span></p>\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2019-10-14","clk_count":"184"}},"__N_SSG":true}